# v1.27 FLEET RETRAIN — the read-back cycle (docs/readback-cycle.md), a BREAK.
#
# WHY. Owner-approved 2026-09-09 ("go with option (a), pair it with the
# read-back cycle"). Four commits on multi-agent-dev (aee56e5 vocabulary,
# 4f5916d garble, 8d37f1f observations, e516504 actions+wiring) changed both
# spaces: OBS_DIM 346 -> 357 (+2 garble, +1 say-again-pending, +4 read-back
# CORRECT heard, +4 DONE confirmed heard — all appended, all heard-on-the-net,
# never telemetry) and N_ACTIONS 237 -> 239 (SAY_AGAIN, READBACK appended).
# Every v1.26 member carries a 346-wide first layer that cannot load on this
# tree: the fleet is orphaned, stated in the spec before the build.
#
# WHAT THE CYCLE SHIPS AND DOES NOT SHIP. Information only. No reward term
# added or changed, no adjudication change — the 2026-09-09 root-evidence
# probe showed an information deficit (reporting roots close ONLY from own
# sight, die at 2.6-3.1 cells; fresh subordinate DONE in hand for 15-29% of
# confirmed claims), so the cycle gives the root the knowledge channel
# (per-sub DONE-heard flags) and gives everyone the verification vocabulary.
# The new transmissions pay the standard airtime cost like all speech (A4).
#
# THE READ IS PRE-REGISTERED: docs/readback-cycle.md §"The read, pre-registered
# before job 1" governs the verdict. Headline: on fireteam draws clearing the
# 0.5 reporting floor, fresh-subordinate-DONE-at-claim must RISE above
# 0.29/0.15 (v17/v19) and root death must fall to <= 0.05 at N>=100 while
# reporting holds. Fleet guard: the other eight scenarios within CI of their
# v1.26 members, Holm-corrected as one family.
#
# SHAPE. 24 jobs, one frozen cohort/ tree, shipped prices (NO --reward
# overrides). Steps mirror each v1.26 member's config.json total_steps.
# 4-seed DECLARED searches (seeds 12-15) for the five known-bimodal reporting
# scenarios — fireteam (bimodal as of 2026-09-09), squad, patrol_brique,
# platoon, platoon_hard — single seed 12 for the rest. Every seed tried is
# listed here and every one goes in seed_search, collapses included.
#
# THE TREE IS FROZEN FROM JOB 1 TO THE LAST LANDING. train.py imports cohort/
# at the moment each job starts; no cohort/ commit while the queue runs.
# Tooling, tests, docs and boards stay free to move.

